{"description":"It's officially Asian Thought Club's 1 year anniversary.\nJoin to celebrate a year of reading and community-building, and if you're new, come out to find out what we're about!\nFood and drinks served at 6:00PM. Dress code is Black Tie formal.\nEVENT FAQ:\nQ: ARE TICKETS REFUNDABLE?\nA: YES, UNTIL 24 HOURS BEFORE THE EVENT.\nQ: WHAT IS BLACK-TIE?\nA: BLACK-TIE IS A FORMAL DRESS CODE, USUALLY A TUX FOR MEN AND A FLOOR-LENGTH DRESS FOR WOMEN.\nFOR OUR GALA, IT’S OKAY TO DRESS IN SOMETHING COMPARABLE, LIKE A SUIT OR COCKTAIL DRESS.","organizer":"Asian Thought Club"}